r mo at magpapadala kami ng update kapag naipadala na ito.','Dummy download in the admin previewUser guide' => 'Gabay sa gumagamit','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (New)' => 'Places API (Bago)','Google Places API versionsPlaces API (Legacy)' => 'Places API (Legacy)','Brasil API versionsVersion 1' => 'Bersyon 1','Brasil API versionsVersion 2' => 'Bersyon 2','Delayed account creation benefits placeholder text✔ Checkout faster next time
